		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target and choose 1 of the following effects. If Soul Touched wasn't removed, this does nothing:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ruin.</strong> Target takes Cold damage equal to your soul power. Ignores armor.</p></li><li><p><strong>Haunt.</strong> Target is Frightened of you, 1 turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Protect.</strong> Target gains temp HP equal to your soul power, 1 round.</p></li></ul><hr><p><em>[A] Grants three separate Rite features to your sheet — Soul Rite: Ruin, Soul Rite: Haunt and Soul Rite: Protect. Use the one you want; each checks and removes your Soul Touched on the target.</em></p><p><em>[M] Characters created before this update: delete and re-add Soul Rite to receive the three Rite features.</em></p>",
